  {
    "description": "Permanently delete a column (attribute) from a Dataverse table. ⚠️ DESTROYS the data stored in that column across ALL records, recoverable only from a full environment backup. Confirm with the user before calling. To rename a column or change its type, follow the migration recipe in update_attribute instead.",
